      "id": "def-affine-cone-projective-set",
      "concern": "The definition allows arbitrary X⊂P_k^n, including X=∅, but asserts that C(X)=V(I_+(X)) “contains 0”. For X=∅, I_+(X) is the whole homogeneous ring (including 1), so C(X)=∅ and does not contain 0.",
